# Local-only developer notes for Hanuja

Add this file as `CLAUDE.local.md` and keep it gitignored.

## Local environment
- Local app URL: http://localhost:3000
- Local seller panel URL: http://localhost:3001
- Local admin panel URL: http://localhost:3002

## Sandbox / test placeholders
- Test seller IBAN: TR00 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 00
- Test customer account: test-customer@example.com
- Test seller account: test-seller@example.com
- Test admin account: test-admin@example.com

## Local reminders
- Use only sandbox payment credentials.
- Do not use production API keys locally.
- Do not disable payout hold logic even in demo flows unless explicitly testing that case.
